{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a first glimpse into the world of <i>Under Destruction</i>, a strategic conflict set in a future ruled by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within a reduced but detailed map, you\u2019ll be able to explore the game\u2019s core mechanics: from managing refineries to engaging in direct combat as Spyro, the AI-controlled war drone. A series of introductory quests will guide players through the foundational systems, showcasing both the interaction with strategic facilities and the destructive potential of the currently available weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: not all weapons or final gameplay features are included in this demo. However, it represents a solid foundation on which we are building a deep, immersive, and action-rich experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876740?t=1753446666","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876740?t=1753446666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876740/6f634d4a441083bee43ab3c9fd9b06563fdeb7fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753446666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876740/6f634d4a441083bee43ab3c9fd9b06563fdeb7fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753446666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of large-scale warfare and destruction between AI and human forces. Although no human characters or blood are depicted, the narrative implies human casualties through the destruction of military vehicles and installations. The setting reflects a dystopian conflict scenario that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a first glimpse into the world of <i>Under Destruction</i>, a strategic conflict set in a future ruled by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within a reduced but detailed map, you\u2019ll be able to explore the game\u2019s core mechanics: from managing refineries to engaging in direct combat as Spyro, the AI-controlled war drone. A series of introductory quests will guide players through the foundational systems, showcasing both the interaction with strategic facilities and the destructive potential of the currently available weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: not all weapons or final gameplay features are included in this demo. However, it represents a solid foundation on which we are building a deep, immersive, and action-rich experience.</p>","developers":["Quantum Dynamics"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3359410","name":"Under Destruction"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876740/417ec3990a7a89aaf6c3fc15db25fd6cb58ed2f0/header.jpg?t=1753446666","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173127,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173127/movie480.mp4?t=1753318122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173127/movie_max.mp4?t=1753318122"},"name":"Under Destruction Official Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173127/b71e87dbdbd48c5d69b6909fe0b51bc161bd9a61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753318122","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173127/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753318122","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173127/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753318122"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257173899,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173899/movie480.mp4?t=1753446661","max":"http://video.akamai.steamsta